    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f514c61c01bdd1e110c41cf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓经典三冠，就是称霸了“皋月赏”、\n“日本德比”和“菊花赏”的赛马娘\n才能获得的称号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d976153df084fa12b7f372f059b17bd82562c776febda6b73857521a7fbd8b33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1267a1a5d3e01185bf42ed0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "达成这项壮举的赛马娘寥寥可数。\n因此，许多赛马娘都很向往这份殊荣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac81760f4c2db932739b1a8e2143241153863628ad53ca71a1cff3d19381ad4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005100.json",
      "json_path": [
