    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5864ab5492a4575fdc14815",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先，我想在经典级的巅峰回应她们的期待。\n将获得荣耀的畅快感献给她们……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f691efd9bfd3891c5a53f21f55ec5e4c72016b4905d7cd755ce8143ca23264e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0546aee493965cfe1e5861aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然要以最棒的娱乐表演者为目标，\n这就是经典级之中最适合的舞台了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f1f5f93a8e764e617d5f207a3018402d202b639c783024b0d7d1b1634f7e38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
